                                                "text": "He's got chainsaws and bombs and an axe / And some unfiltered cigarettes too / He will unleash mass destruction, you're dead / You just got trashed... it's the ¶ Attack of the Wrath of the / War of the Death of the / Strike of the Sword of the / Blood... of the Beast"
