                                                "sense_id": "493a6043-5028-36ea-9551-e857ed7676c0",
                                                "text": "She is a classic omnivert who loves playing around with a bunch of unfiltered thoughts and biochemical things. She is a firm believer of 'everyone & everything around has a story to tell' and is on the journey to decipher all those tales."
